:"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/np","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5548?"},"repo":{"id":1425816765,"name":"VictorTaelin/uniichat","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VictorTaelin/uniichat"},"payload":{"action":"started"},"public":true,"created_at":"2026-10-20T20:22:18Z"},{"id":"17747844026","type":"IssueCommentEvent","actor":{"id":35239587,"login":"arteeh","display_login":"arteeh","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteeh","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35239587?"},"repo":{"id":1425816765,"name":"VictorTaelin/uniichat","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VictorTaelin/uniichat"},"payload":{"action":"created","issue":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VictorTaelin/uniichat/issues/28","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VictorTaelin/uniichat","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VictorTaelin/uniichat/issues/28/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VictorTaelin/uniichat/issues/28/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VictorTaelin/uniichat/issues/28/events","html_url":"https://github.com/VictorTaelin/uniichat/pull/28","id":5935054935,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVPw8vc8AAAABJd5WmA","number":28,"title":"Encrypt API keys at rest (#9)","user":{"login":"arteeh","id":35239587,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MjM5NTg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35239587?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteeh","html_url":"https://github.com/arteeh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteeh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteeh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteeh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteeh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteeh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteeh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteeh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteeh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteeh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-20T02:50:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:39Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:18Z","assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VictorTaelin/uniichat/pulls/28","html_url":"https://github.com/VictorTaelin/uniichat/pull/28","diff_url":"https://github.com/VictorTaelin/uniichat/pull/28.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/VictorTaelin/uniichat/pull/28.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #9.\n\nAPI keys can now be stored encrypted at rest, sealed with a passphrase.\n\n**How it works**\n- Keys live in `keys.enc` (mode 600): AES-256-GCM (16-byte tag), key derived with scrypt (N=2^17, r=8, p=1; KDF parameters recorded in the file).\n- Passphrase from `UNII_PASSPHRASE_FILE` (works with a systemd credential), `UNII_PASSPHRASE`, or a hidden prompt on a TTY. The prompt turns echo off and restores the terminal on SIGINT/SIGTERM/SIGHUP.\n- Keys given in the environment override the stored ones and get sealed in.\n- Workers get their keys over a stdin pipe, not the environment or a memfd, so they are not readable from `/proc/<pid>/environ` or `/proc/<pid>/fd/0`.\n- `keys.enc` writes are serialized under a lock, written fully, fsynced, then renamed.\n- A deploy (SIGHUP) whose new worker can't take the handover is refused alone; healthy workers keep running. A crash respawn that can't take it exits.\n- The README says plainly what this protects (keys at rest on disk) and what it doesn't (a same-user attacker on a running server, core dumps unless `ProcessSizeMax=0`).\n\n**Tested**\n- `bun test`: 56 pass. `tsc` strict: no new errors vs base.\n- Browser and worker end-to-end runs against a fake model API; signal and TTY cases; concu